{"ID":"20240511110552-afarxbo","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240511110552-afarxbo","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240511110552-afarxbo\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240511112629-q91irfz\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240511131652-gbayefj\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513125228-ex6x2xg\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:38,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:38\u0026#125;","title":"汉唐-029号（消痔丸）","type":"doc","updated":"20240513125228"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240511112629-q91irfz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511112629-q91irfz","updated":"20240511112629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生理过程与HT-9是一样的，但此丸是治疗第一种的痔疮，即是外痔，主要症状∶又痛又痒，在肛门口生红肿炙热痛，时排出浓稠之液体，大便後擦肛门时会见有一些微血。"}]},{"ID":"20240511112629-duxz34z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511112629-duxz34z","updated":"20240511112629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"服用此方一段时间後，自然会回复，且无副作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240511112629-nlw376j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511112629-nlw376j","updated":"20240511112629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"此方与HT-9最大不同处，在於HT-9要应付大量的出血且无痛，这是直肠已产生廔管的现象，故方剂内容完全不同，HT-9的止血力强，有收敛廔管的功效，故吾人须立二方来治疗痔疮。"}]},{"ID":"20240511112629-tjunxuy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511112629-tjunxuy","updated":"20240511112629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主要成份∶黄芩丶黄莲丶枳实丶麻仁……等。"}]},{"ID":"20240511112629-xf6wjcm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511112629-xf6wjcm","updated":"20240511112629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"副作用∶无。"}]},{"ID":"20240511112629-ki4w6a7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511112629-ki4w6a7","updated":"20240511112629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"任何人均可服用，不须医师处方，常人服法早晚饭前25粒，严重病人加服到40粒均可，毫无危险。"}]},{"ID":"20240511112629-x6onalp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511112629-x6onalp","updated":"20240511112629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"研发人∶美国佛州汉唐中医学院，院长倪海厦医师。"}]},{"ID":"20240511112629-jquya03","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511112629-jquya03","updated":"20240511112629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"着作权人∶同上。"}]},{"ID":"20240511112629-hqgqto9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511112629-hqgqto9","updated":"20240511112629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"此方是我实际临床之经验方,不含任何有毒性的中药在内. 美国汉唐中医诊所专用处方."}]},{"ID":"20240511131650-22druaf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511131650-22druaf"}},{"ID":"20240513125228-ex6x2xg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240513125228-ex6x2xg","updated":"20240513125228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"消痔丸(大便後排一點血,脹痛)(西醫學之外痔)，類似於仙豐製作的克志29號。"}]},{"ID":"20240511131651-5j7zgws","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240511131651-5j7zgws"}},{"ID":"20240511131652-ci20cr3","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240511131652-ci20cr3","updated":"20240511131654"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"HT-29　消痔丸"}]},{"ID":"20240511131652-orhhp6m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511131652-orhhp6m","updated":"20240511131652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（2006.11.27 B　录校：王志峰）"}]},{"ID":"20240511131652-xpg8d1z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511131652-xpg8d1z","updated":"20240511131652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"现在讲汉唐二十九号消痔丸，汉唐九号的时候也讲过，先看原文："}]},{"ID":"20240511131652-3h4py6z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511131652-3h4py6z","updated":"20240511151803"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"生理过程与HT--9是一样的，但此丸是治疗第一种的痔疮，即是外痔，主要症状︰又痛又痒，在肛门口生红肿炙热痛，时排出浓稠之液体，大便后擦肛门时会见有一些微血。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240511131652-2lgrbwn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511131652-2lgrbwn","updated":"20240511131652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这种情况，无论是外痔或内痔，其机理和病因都是一样的。一定要注意升其气血，然后标症者治标，要解毒气，同时痔疮病是人类特有的病，其它动物都没有，有便前血和便后血，汉唐九号的时候都说了。"}]},{"ID":"20240511131652-x1wwnfg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511131652-x1wwnfg","updated":"20240511151808"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"服用此方后自然便会回复，且无副作用。此方与HT--9最大不同处，在于HT--9要应付大量的出血且无痛，这是直肠已产生廔管的现象，故方剂内容完全不同，HT--9的止血力强，有收敛廔管的功效，故吾人须立二方来治疗痔疮。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240511131652-i2r5p11","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511131652-i2r5p11","updated":"20240511131652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"就是说，汉唐九号基本上是适用于内痔，而二十九号是治疗外痔，外痔的这一个治法，同时也要升其气血，这是关键，它的用就是治其本，还有其用，便是治疗其标，这情况是解其毒气，这就可以了，互相参照。这一个轻轻一点就过去。"}]},{"ID":"20240511131652-ypsxdpq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511131652-ypsxdpq","updated":"20240511151811"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"主要成份︰黄芩、黄莲、枳实、麻仁……等。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240511131652-kglltpc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511131652-kglltpc","updated":"20240511151812"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"副作用︰无。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240511131652-51535b7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511131652-51535b7","updated":"20240511151814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"任何人均可服用，不须医师处方，常人服法早晚饭前25粒，严重病人加服到40粒均可，毫无危险。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240511131652-gbayefj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511131652-gbayefj","updated":"20240511151814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"研发人︰美国佛州汉唐中医学院，院长倪海厦医师。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]}]}